WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:01.980
<i>I want to go home.</i>

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Today, I really want to 
go home at a normal time.</i>

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:13.490
<i>Or at least, I want some comfort.</i>

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:15.400
Good work, Mima-san!

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.270
Here's a coffee for you.

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:18.240
Thank you.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:22.210
Would you be willing to be
 in the company's PR clip again?

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.000
<b>Fawn  fawn</b>

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.130
It would be quite a hit with the ladies.

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.550
Sure.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:26.670
Yay!

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.460
Mima! Do you know where Tanaka-san is?

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.890
Tanaka-san was on the phone 
and left a little while ago.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:36.110
Oh.

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:39.680
Should be back pretty soon.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.720
<i>He missed the spout just now.</i>

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:43.750
Mima, got a sec?

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:44.510
Yes, sir.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.000
Is now okay?

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:46.880
Yes.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.570
Excuse me, I'll see what's up.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:49.740
Sure.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.210
So about yesterday's thing,

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:54.440
there was an issue with 
the site's architecture.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.560
Yes, they're auditing
 that right now.

00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:59.960
I'll have a fix ready by tomorrow.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.860
Thank you, that helps a lot.

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:03.230
Did you see that earlier?

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.040
I did.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:07.490
A hot, clumsy man is a 
real balm for the soul.

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:08.850
It certainly is.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:11.390
I mean, he's unofficially in charge 
of soothing everybody here.

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:14.760
And with that, let's get 
back to work all refreshed!

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:16.100
Yeah!

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:18.710
<i>How can everybody be so full of energy?</i>

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:22.680
<i>I want some comfort.</i>

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:23.890
Slurp

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:24.180
Hot!

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:24.190
Fawn!

